     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem NIHSS1aLOC</b></p><a name=\"NIHSS1aLOC\"> </a><a name=\"hcNIHSS1aLOC\"> </a><p>This  code system <code>https://kip.rkkp.dk/fhir/CodeSystem/NIHSS1aLOC</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">0<a name=\"NIHSS1aLOC-0\"> </a></td><td>Alert; keenly responsive.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">1<a name=\"NIHSS1aLOC-1\"> </a></td><td>Not alert; but arousable by minor stimulation to obey, answer, or respond.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">2<a name=\"NIHSS1aLOC-2\"> </a></td><td>Not alert; requires repeated stimulation to attend, or is obtunded and requires strong or painful stimulation to make movements (not stereotyped).</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">3<a name=\"NIHSS1aLOC-3\"> </a></td><td>Responds only with reflex motor or autonomic effects or totally unresponsive, flaccid, and areflexic.</td></tr></table></div>"
